flowchart TD
  IN[User Request] --> MODE{Install, Request, Resume, Reconcile?}
  MODE -->|Install / Legacy| DISC[AI-led Discovery]
  DISC --> ASIS[Record As-Is Baseline, Pros, Cons, Evidence]
  ASIS -->|No change request| WAIT[Persist Handoff and Wait]
  ASIS -->|Change request exists| PROBLEM[Problem and Product Intent]
  MODE -->|Project Request / Resume| STATE[Read Manifest, Canonical Artifacts, Run Events]
  STATE --> PROBLEM
  PROBLEM --> COMPOSE[Master Composes and Validates Dynamic Pipeline]
  COMPOSE --> ARCH[Architecture Specialists: Alternatives and Recommendation]
  ARCH --> APPROVAL{Lucas selects / approves baseline?}
  APPROVAL -->|No / revise| ARCH
  APPROVAL -->|Yes| BACKLOG[Backlog Specialists: Epic, Feature, Story, Task]
  BACKLOG --> ENG[Engineering Specialists: Contracts and Technical Design]
  ENG --> DEV[Development Specialists: Test First, Implement, Verify]
  DEV --> QA[Independent Review, QA, Integration/E2E]
  QA -->|Fail| DEV
  QA -->|Pass| HOMOLOG[Prepare Homologation Evidence]
  HOMOLOG --> CLIENT{Homologation approved?}
  CLIENT -->|No / changes| BACKLOG
  CLIENT -->|Yes, GMUD not required| STOP[Handoff and Stop Before Production]
  CLIENT -->|Yes, GMUD required| GMUD[Prepare and Record Post-Homologation GMUD]
  GMUD -->|Pending / rejected| WAIT
  GMUD -->|Authorized| STOP
  ENG -->|Architecture conflict| ESC[Engineering to Architect Escalation]
  DEV -->|Architecture conflict| ESC
  ESC --> SOLVE[Architect supplies evidence and proposed solution]
  SOLVE --> REOPEN{Lucas authorizes reopening?}
  REOPEN -->|No| WAIT
  REOPEN -->|Yes| ARCH
